<title>UK: Keiyo sets $100 mln five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Keiyo sets $100 mln five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Yamaichi.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KEIYO CO LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  BANK OF TOKYO-MITSUBISHI</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    16.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +20 BP    PAY DATE    16.JUL.97</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   30 BP</p>
<p> LISTING     UNLISTED  PAY FREQ   SEMI-ANN  DENOMS (M) ONE</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP  NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES</p>
<p> FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)  GOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
